ysis: short data-analysis questions on small tables — finding runs of consecutive growth, mapping the columns of one table onto another, and converting a table between formats — each with a single correct answer, graded against ground truth. Each question costs far less than an agentic task.","Reasoning: short logic, spatial and theory-of-mind questions, each with a single correct answer, graded against ground truth. Each question costs far less than an agentic task.","Models run at their highest supported effort setting. Where a different setting was used, it is shown in the model's expanded row.","Overall is the mean of the suites a model has a score for. Blank and n/a cells are left out. Every suite counts equally."],"provenance":{"releaseKey":"20261025","releaseLabel":"2026-10-25","assets":[{"url":"https://livebench.ai/data/20261025/table.csv","sha256":"92aca6ce8a77cad85b27bda3fea5556029770e720c8fe3ec0371c6471355df36"},{"url":"https://livebench.ai/data/20261025/categories.json","sha256":"b5366a69719445fa91e970de6f248c666115bbc5d8b8d134f33bb5fcc399a7ce"},{"url":"https://livebench.ai/data/20261025/cost.csv","sha256":"bbfc36eb595d02d3469f81cf3301a0d4fcdeffb7d680c36bb372b0b1bac1118b"},{"url":"https://livebench.ai/data/20261025/notes.json","sha256":"a6bd6c8fe1ba7ce26dbdb46e20df6e270ce87e5e6677b90ac51fbe809da6fdbc"}],"applicationScript":"https://livebench.ai/static/js/main.4228bafc.js"},"withdrawn":[{"id":"weighted","reason":"不同量纲的原始分不能直接相加；版本和测试配置尚未跨源核验。"},{"id":"aider-polyglot","reason":"历史编程测试不作为当前模型排行，停止展示。"}]}
